  <AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.confined_interior.description>这地方真是小得妙极了。被结实的墙体环绕让我感到安全且舒适。</AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.confined_interior.description>
  <!-- EN: cramped interior -->
  <AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.cramped_interior.label>紧凑的空间</AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.cramped_interior.label>
