  <AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.cramped_interior.description>这地方小得恰到好处。没必要浪费那么多的空间。</AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.cramped_interior.description>
  <!-- EN: spacious interior -->
  <AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.spacious_interior.label>宽敞的空间</AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.spacious_interior.label>
  <!-- EN: This room is far too expansive. All this empty space makes me feel exposed. -->
  <AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.spacious_interior.description>我身处的空间过于宽敞了。我感觉自己就好像被人看光了一样。</AM_RoomSize_Small.stages.spacious_interior.description>
  
